```console
$ scherzo-cloud publication list --help
List Scherzo Cloud publications

Usage: scherzo-cloud publication list [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION> <RUN>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <RUN>           Exact Run ID

Options:
      --limit <LIMIT>        Maximum items to return (1-200)
      --cursor <CURSOR>      Opaque continuation cursor
      --json                 Print the publication result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
